In this rectangular array of 20 dots (arranged in 5 rows and 4 columns), four dots are to be chosen at random. What is the probability that the four dots will be collinear? Express your answer as a common fraction.

[asy]
size(74);
for(int i = 0; i<5; ++i)
for(int j = 0; j<4; ++j)
dot((i,j),linewidth(7));
[/asy]
